<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transcrypt Int'l.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transcrypt Int'l.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of Transcrypt International Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said the company is a leader in scrambling and encryption products.  Transcrypt's products target the radio, cellular, wireline and data communications markets.</p>
<p>-- said Transcrypt has a strong, profitable core business.</p>
<p>-- expects Transcrypt to earn $0.55 in 1997 and $0.82 in 1998.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
